        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953580/extras/e8ca6072c8a76c45e91f3f19eb43b43b.poster.avif?t=1761666666\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953580/extras/e8ca6072c8a76c45e91f3f19eb43b43b.webm?t=1761666666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953580/extras/e8ca6072c8a76c45e91f3f19eb43b43b.mp4?t=1761666666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><br>Vendigo Corporation -</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in an underground facility. You will explore dark corridors, eerie rooms, and face unknown threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy atmosphere: corridors, laboratories, and unsettling environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of monsters lurking in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small but clever puzzles integrated into the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes and documents that reveal the story and guide your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeper look into the corporation’s dark experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: survive, discover, and escape.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953580/extras/396392357166eee34b5a769340b44082.avif?t=1761666666\" width=1560 height=756 /></span></p></li></ul>",
